<h1>Your {{ brand_name }} verification code</h1>
<p>Hello {{ recipient_name }},</p>
<p>Enter this code to verify your new sign-in: <strong>{{ code }}</strong></p>
<p>The code expires in 10 minutes. If you did not try to sign in, reset your password.</p>
<p><a href="{{ reset_password_url }}">Reset your password</a></p>
{% if browser_name or platform_name %}<p>Device: {{ browser_name }} {{ platform_name }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if ip %}<p>IP address: {{ ip }}</p>{% endif %}
